  "scale": "1/60",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "７本の剣と銃を備えた機体としてイノベイターに覚醒した刹那・F・セイエイと共に戦場に舞い降りる。武装に加え、機体本体にも新規造形パーツを追加。『機動戦士ガンダム００V戦記』に活躍した機体がPGでキット化！",
      "en": "As a machine equipped with seven swords and a gun, it descends onto the battlefield with Setsuna F. Seiei, who has awakened as an innovator. In addition to the weapons, new modeling parts have been added to the aircraft body. The aircraft that played an active role in \"Mobile Suit Gundam 00V Senki\" is now a PG kit!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "洗練されたプロポ―ション、一新されたカラーリングや質感表現。",
      "en": "Refined proportions, new coloring and texture expression."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 脚部・頭部・肩部など各部のプロポーションを調整。新規造形パーツにより、より洗練された印象に。",
      "en": "• Adjust the proportions of each part such as legs, head, shoulders, etc. Newly molded parts give it a more sophisticated impression."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 質感を重視した成形素材を採用。海老川兼武氏監修のもと、成形色も一新。",
      "en": "• Uses molded material with an emphasis on texture. Under the supervision of Mr. Kanetake Ebikawa, the molding color has also been renewed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "武装パーツは可変・発光ギミックを網羅",
      "en": "Armed parts cover variable and light emitting gimmicks"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNバスターソードIIはLEDによる発光ギミックを再現。",
      "en": "• GN Buster Sword II reproduces the LED light emitting gimmick."
    },
    {
      "ja": "設定形状を読み解き、詳細な導光解析・設計を行うことで新機構の導光パーツを新規開発（特許出願中）",
      "en": "Newly developed light guide parts with new mechanisms by understanding the set shape and performing detailed light guide analysis and design (patent pending)"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 大型武装GNソードIIブラスターも全長約340mm大型サイズで再現。",
      "en": "• The large armed GN Sword II Blaster is also reproduced in a large size with a total length of approximately 340mm."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNカタールは単体での脚部へのマウント、連結状態など様々なバリエーションを再現可能。",
      "en": "• GN Qatar can reproduce various variations such as being mounted on the leg as a single unit, or connected."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• GNソードIIロング/ショート形態を差し替えで再現可能、ロングはライフル状態でのグリップ展開、ショートは射出形態をリード線を使って再現できる。",
      "en": "• GN Sword II Long/Short forms can be reproduced by replacing them. The long version can be used with the grip deployed in rifle mode, and the short version can be used with the ejection form using the lead wire."
    }
  ],
